# Prisma migrations

- Keep the full `apps/api/prisma/migrations/` history; never squash folders. One folder = one schema change. Never `db push` on a shared database.
- After adding a migration, regenerate the single production SQL: `node apps/api/scripts/build-hostinger-sql.mjs` (`docs/deployment/hostinger-db.sql`; it also records `_prisma_migrations`).
- A new database on Hostinger: import the file from `--users` (see `docs/deployment/hostinger.md`). An existing one: apply only the new `migration.sql`.
- Never `prisma db seed` on Hostinger.
